<section class="hoy-about-founder color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}">
  <div class="hoy-about-founder__hero page-width">
    <h1 class="hoy-about-founder__title">House of Yeashi, built with heart by Vanshika Srivastava</h1>

    <div class="hoy-about-founder__intro">
      <p class="hoy-about-founder__eyebrow">Meet the Founder</p>
      <p class="hoy-about-founder__lead">
        Hi, I am <strong>Vanshika Srivastava</strong>, a 31-year-old entrepreneur based in Gurugram, a proud mom,
        and the founder of <strong>House of Yeashi</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Born and brought up in the beautiful city of Lucknow, I have always believed that jewellery is much more
        than just an accessory. To me, it is the finishing touch that completes an outfit, reflects your personality,
        and gives you that little extra confidence before stepping out.
      </p>
      <a class="hoy-about-founder__button" href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/ocean-muse-layered-necklace">
        Shop New Arrivals
      </a>
    </div>

    <figure class="hoy-about-founder__portrait-wrap">
      <img
        src="{{ 'hoy-founder-vanshika.jpg' | asset_url }}"
        width="1350"
        height="1800"
        alt="Vanshika Srivastava, founder of House of Yeashi"
        class="hoy-about-founder__portrait"
        loading="eager"
      >
      <figcaption>Vanshika Srivastava, Founder</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <div class="hoy-about-founder__story page-width">
    <div class="hoy-about-founder__section">
      <h2>Why I Started House of Yeashi</h2>
      <p>
        Growing up, I loved styling my outfits with jewellery, but I often struggled to find pieces that were unique,
        trendy, and affordable. Most local stores carried repetitive designs, while online shopping often meant
        compromising on quality or paying high prices and expensive shipping for pieces I genuinely loved.
      </p>
      <p>That experience stayed with me.</p>
      <p>
        After moving to Gurugram, I realised that thousands of women faced the same problem I did. We all wanted
        jewellery that looked premium, followed the latest trends, and could be worn every day without spending a
        fortune.
      </p>
      <p>
        That is when I decided to create <strong>House of Yeashi</strong>: a brand where every woman can find
        thoughtfully curated jewellery that is stylish, long-lasting, and affordable.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hoy-about-founder__section hoy-about-founder__section--accent">
      <h2>Gifting Should Feel Effortless</h2>
      <p>
        I wanted to build a place where gifting became simple and joyful. Choosing the perfect gift should not feel
        stressful. It should feel exciting.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether it is for your sister, your wife, your best friend, your mother, or even yourself, we want every gift
        to create a memory that lasts long after the box is opened.
      </p>
      <p>
        That is why we also curate personalised hampers filled with thoughtfully selected accessories like hair
        accessories, mobile charms, bag charms, and more, all designed around your budget and the personality of the
        person you are gifting.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hoy-about-founder__section">
      <h2>More Than Just a Jewellery Brand</h2>
      <p>
        House of Yeashi is about helping you celebrate birthdays, Rakshabandhan, anniversaries, milestones,
        friendships, and all those little moments that deserve to be remembered.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every hamper is packed by hand with the same care and attention we would give if we were creating it for
        someone in our own family.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hoy-about-founder__quality">
    <div class="page-width">
      <div class="hoy-about-founder__quality-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="hoy-about-founder__eyebrow">What Makes Us Different</p>
          <h2>Premium jewellery made for everyday wear</h2>
          <p>
            We believe quality should never be compromised. Our jewellery is thoughtfully curated to feel timeless,
            elegant, and wearable long after the latest trend has passed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="hoy-about-founder__promise-list" aria-label="House of Yeashi jewellery promises">
          <li>Anti-tarnish</li>
          <li>Waterproof</li>
          <li>Skin-friendly</li>
          <li>Durable for everyday wear</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hoy-about-founder__story page-width">
    <div class="hoy-about-founder__section">
      <h2>Our Journey So Far</h2>
      <p>
        What started as a dream has now become a growing community of jewellery lovers. We have already had the
        privilege of styling and serving <strong>100+ happy customers</strong>, and every order reminds us why we
        started this journey.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every review, every customer photo, and every message motivates us to keep improving and bringing you
        collections you will genuinely love.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hoy-about-founder__section">
      <h2>Beyond the Brand</h2>
      <p>
        Before becoming a full-time entrepreneur and mom, I completed my Master's in Political Science and explored
        different paths that taught me resilience, creativity, and the value of building meaningful relationships.
        Along the way, I also worked with digital marketing businesses, which deepened my understanding of how to
        build brands that connect with people.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I am not curating jewellery or packing your orders, you will probably find me dancing, reading a good
        book, spending time with my furry companion <strong>Oreo</strong>, or making memories with my little one.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hoy-about-founder__closing">
      <h2>A Personal Promise</h2>
      <p>
        When you choose House of Yeashi, you are not just supporting a small business. You are supporting a dream
        built with love, late nights, countless lessons, and a genuine passion for making people feel special.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our promise is simple: to bring you jewellery you will actually wear, gifts you will be proud to give, and an
        experience that always feels personal.
      </p>
      <p class="hoy-about-founder__signature">
        Thank you for being a part of our journey.<br>
        With love,<br>
        <strong>Vanshika Srivastava</strong><br>
        <span>Founder, House of Yeashi</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  .hoy-about-founder {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #20170f;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 980px);
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 28px;
    padding-block: 64px 72px;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__intro,
  .hoy-about-founder__section,
  .hoy-about-founder__closing,
  .hoy-about-founder__quality-grid > div {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: #9a6b12;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder h1,
  .hoy-about-founder h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #20170f;
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__title {
    margin-inline: auto;
    max-width: none;
    font-size: 2.15rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-align: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__intro {
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.12;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder p {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    color: rgb(32 23 15 / 0.78);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__lead {
    color: #20170f;
    font-size: 1.12rem;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding-inline: 28px;
    border: 1px solid #20170f;
    background: #20170f;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__button:hover {
    background: #c99a2e;
    border-color: #c99a2e;
    color: #111111;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__portrait-wrap {
    width: min(100%, 420px);
    margin: 4px auto 0;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__portrait {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 720px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 34%;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__portrait-wrap figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: rgb(32 23 15 / 0.64);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__story {
    display: grid;
    gap: 44px;
    padding-block: 28px 64px;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__section {
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__section--accent {
    max-width: 920px;
    padding: 36px;
    border-left: 4px solid #c99a2e;
    background: #fff8e7;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__quality {
    background: #20170f;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__quality-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(280px, 0.62fr);
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: 56px;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__quality h2,
  .hoy-about-founder__quality p,
  .hoy-about-founder__quality .hoy-about-founder__eyebrow {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__quality .hoy-about-founder__eyebrow {
    color: #f5d47c;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__promise-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__promise-list li {
    min-height: 72px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__closing {
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 40px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(32 23 15 / 0.12);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 54px rgb(32 23 15 / 0.08);
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__signature {
    color: #20170f;
  }

  .hoy-about-founder__signature span {
    color: rgb(32 23 15 / 0.64);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 899px) {
    .hoy-about-founder__hero,
    .hoy-about-founder__quality-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .hoy-about-founder__hero {
      padding-block: 40px 52px;
    }

    .hoy-about-founder__title {
      max-width: 100%;
      font-size: 1.65rem;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .hoy-about-founder h2 {
      font-size: 1.55rem;
    }

    .hoy-about-founder__portrait {
      max-height: 440px;
    }

    .hoy-about-founder__portrait-wrap {
      width: min(100%, 320px);
    }

    .hoy-about-founder__section--accent,
    .hoy-about-founder__closing {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .hoy-about-founder__promise-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About founder",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
